(text "Compute module — CM5 connectors, 5 V input and fan" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9cef786a-f401-4f6f-9c91-bdc88720574a"))
(text "CC1 and CC2 are open, so the CM5 sees no USB PD supply: set PSU_MAX_CURRENT=5000 in the EEPROM config\nto lift the USB current limit. SD pins are open: use a CM5 with eMMC, or boot a CM5 Lite from NVMe." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "23b9f6c3-6a45-4962-bd25-62268db98033"))
(text "Status light" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ce40da3b-fd46-4f7c-b71b-ff5e185445e2"))
(text "D101 sits at the front edge. GPIO10 (SPI0 MOSI) drives it\nthrough U101 at 5 V, as on the main board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 261.62 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "736592ae-2d14-4254-b1ab-d4144e08d4ae"))
